# Licenses

Zaviya is a Linux distribution made up of many open-source components. Each component is provided under its own license.

## Project software

Original software and scripts developed for SteamOS-ARM-SM8550, and the
SM8650 additions in this repository, are licensed under the terms of the
[GNU GPL Version 2](https://www.gnu.org/licenses/old-licenses/gpl-2.0.html).

Vendor trees keep their own licenses (Linux kernel GPL-2.0, Decky plugins
GPL-3.0-or-later, gamescope BSD-2-Clause, and others). See [`CREDITS.md`](CREDITS.md).

## lsfg-vk

The ARM64 frame generation layer (`sm8650-overlay/usr/lib/liblsfg-vk-layer-arm64.so`)
is lsfg-vk 2.0 by PancakeTAS (https://lsfg-vk.dev), compiled for aarch64 from
the official source with no code changes. It is licensed under
[CC BY-NC-ND 4.0](sm8650-overlay/usr/share/licenses/lsfg-vk/LICENSE.txt), not
under this project's license: it may be shared free of charge and unmodified,
with credit, and not used commercially. Only its Vulkan layer manifest is
renamed (`VK_LAYER_LSFGVK_frame_generation_arm64`) so it can sit next to the
plugin's x86 layer. Lossless Scaling itself is sold separately on Steam and is
not included.

